 "note": "The Town Hall 19 update (Nov 16, 2026) from the wiki, read Nov 16, 2026. The wiki is still being updated for the release, so some values may change. TBA = not on the wiki yet. Squads deploy a fixed group of troops in a set formation, using less housing space than the same troops trained one by one. Squad troops use your own researched troop levels, and squads can't be donated. Each Squad Barracks level (Army Buildings, from TH 8) unlocks one squad; training is free and instant. From Laboratory 17 (TH 19) squads can be upgraded to level 2 and up, which unlocks their squad ability. Housing space, troop counts and upgrade costs haven't been revealed yet.",
